{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ars Vox Arcana</strong> is a voice-driven fantasy <strong>duel-game</strong> where you command magic through spoken incantations. <br>Whether in full VR or with PC and mouse and keyboard, you take the role of a wizard whose words shape reality. This is more than spellcasting. This is language-born sorcery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description0.png?t=1743190762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Engage in magical duels with your friends, where strategy and spellcasting skill determine the victor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description1.png?t=1743190762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Say the words, shape the world. Build incantations in real time using modular arcane phrases. Each word changes the result\u2014no menus, just magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description2.png?t=1743190762\" />Ars Vox Arcana is built for VR immersion, but fully supports traditional PC play.<br>Both modes offer the same depth, spellcraft, and progression.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description3.png?t=1743190762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine hidden forms, elements, and whispers of power. Discover new interactions, refine your ritual voice, and experiment with arcane structures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description5.png?t=1743190762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything is processed locally for seamless and private spellcasting. No cloud, no delays\u2014your voice acts instantly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description6.png?t=1743190762\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock deeper layers of language. Find fragments of forgotten speech, each a piece of a greater magical truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3242830?t=1743190762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/ff0e0b19d9e442329e15d4fa630ca29b43be917d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743190762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/a4412569aaec1d80c2a235e40d5a04c8298c08e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743190762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/a4412569aaec1d80c2a235e40d5a04c8298c08e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743190762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ars Vox Arcana</strong> is a voice-driven fantasy <strong>duel-game</strong> where you command magic through spoken incantations. <br>Whether in full VR or with PC and mouse and keyboard, you take the role of a wizard whose words shape reality. This is more than spellcasting. This is language-born sorcery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s